WEBVTT

00:07:28.736 --> 00:07:30.821
But there also can be risks

00:07:30.863 --> 00:07:35.409
when they're also increasingly
characterized by low pay,

00:07:35.451 --> 00:07:37.995
no benefits, job insecurity,

00:07:38.037 --> 00:07:40.206
lack of employer responsibility

00:07:40.247 --> 00:07:42.458
and are primed for labor violations

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:44.043
like wage theft.

00:07:44.084 --> 00:07:46.170
They may be further prone
to labor practices

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:48.881
that are quite harmful and humiliating,

00:07:48.923 --> 00:07:51.300
but perfectly legal.

00:07:51.342 --> 00:07:55.763
US labor laws are still based
on relatively traditional definitions

00:07:55.804 --> 00:07:59.308
and relationships between employers
and their employees.